  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through next Tuesday)\nIssued at 101 PM CST Wed Nov 18 2026\n\nQuiet weather continues Friday and Saturday with dry air and mostly \nsunny skies. Afternoon high temps will stay in the lower to middle \n60's and lows generally in the 40s. A cold front is forecast to move \nthrough the region late Saturday night and therefore cooler temps \nare on tap for Sunday and into early next week. Highs are forecast \nto stay in the 40s with lows in the upper 20s to low 30s across the \narea during this period. The next chance of precipitation will be\novernight Monday night into Tuesday morning with 30-40% chance\npops during this period as a shortwave trough approaches the\nregion.",
